			"notes": "## v1.0.0\n\n- Rename mod to `Modern Beta Annoyances Fix` (prev. `Beta Annoyances Fix`)\n- Rescope the mod to now be intended _specifically_ for use on the Modern Beta server, rather than a more generic/broad scope.\n    - As a result, you can no longer configure what items are considered \"beta foods.\"\n- Added eight more features:\n    - Disabled flattening grass (into paths.)\n    - Disabled off-handing entirely.\n    - Disabled stripping logs.\n    - Logs are always placed upright.\n    - Stairs are always placed upright, and cannot form corners.\n    - Slabs are always placed on the bottom half of the block.\n    - Fences only connect to other fences.\n    - Trapdoors are always placed on the bottom half of the block, and can only be placed on solid blocks (no slabs or stairs.)\n- Restructure config screen to support the above changes\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/KeeningDawn/modern-beta-annoyances-fix/compare/0.1.2...1.0.0"
		},
