			"notes": "## v0.1.1\n\n- Initial mod release\n    - Cookies stack to 8.\n    - All other food (Bread, Raw Fish, Cooked Fish, Raw Porkchop, Cooked Porkchop) stack to 1.\n    - Eggs stacks to 16.\n    - Miscellaneous items (Door, Sign) stack to 1.\n- Mod Menu can be used to adjust whether to enable or disable these adjustments, and in the case of food, adjust valid item id(s) to also treat as those food item(s)."
